'''Talonflame''' (Japanese: '''ファイアロー''' ''Fiarrow'') is a {{ct|Fire}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Secluded Springs}} expansion.

